The Chiron can accelerate from {{convert|0-100|kph|mph|abbr=on}} in 2.4 seconds according to the manufacturer, {{convert|0-200|kph|mph|abbr=on}} in 6.5 seconds and {{convert|0-300|kph|mph|abbr=on}} in 13.6 seconds. In a world-record-setting test at the time in 2017, the Chiron reached {{convert|400|kph|mph|0|abbr=on}} in 32.6 seconds, after which it needed 9.4 seconds to brake to standstill.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.volkswagenag.com/en/news/2017/09/Bugatti_Chiron.html|title=0-400-0 km/h in 42 seconds: Bugatti Chiron sets world record|publisher=Volkswagen AG|date=2017-09-11|access-date=2017-09-13|archive-date=2017-09-13|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170913183901/https://www.volkswagenag.com/en/news/2017/09/Bugatti_Chiron.html|url-status=live}}</ref>

The Chiron's top speed is electronically limited to {{convert|261|mph|kph|0|abbr=on|order=flip}}, or {{convert|233-236|mph|kph|abbr=on|order=flip}} without the specific key, for safety reasons, mainly arising from the tyres as Bugatti concluded that no tyre currently manufactured would be able to handle the stress at the top speed the Chiron is capable of achieving.<ref name=CarAndDriver>{{cite news |url=http://www.caranddriver.com/bugatti/chiron |title=Bugatti Chiron |first=Alexander |last=Stoklosa |work=Car and Driver |location=US |date=February 2016 |access-date=2016-03-23 |archive-date=2016-03-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160324030630/http://www.caranddriver.com/bugatti/chiron |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.roadandtrack.com/new-cars/car-technology/a10187823/bugatti-chiron-top-speed-tires/ |title=The Bugatti Chiron Can't Max Out its 310-MPH Speedo Until Someone Makes a Tire That Can Withstand Those Speeds |first=Chris |last=Perkins |work=Road and Track |location=US |date=2012-06-21 |access-date=2018-11-17 |archive-date=2018-11-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20181117063316/https://www.roadandtrack.com/new-cars/car-technology/a10187823/bugatti-chiron-top-speed-tires/ |url-status=live }}</ref> Independent testing by an owner has indicated that the Chiron can easily attain its limited top speed.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.techeblog.com/bugatti-chiron-261-mph-top-speed/ |title=Bugatti Chiron Hits 261 MPH in New Top Speed Run, Sounds Like a Jet Fighter Blasting Off |date=2018-12-16 |publisher=Tech e blog |access-date=2019-01-28 |archive-date=2019-01-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190129005900/https://www.techeblog.com/bugatti-chiron-261-mph-top-speed/ |url-status=live }}</ref> Mixed fuel consumption is {{cvt|22.5|L/100km|2}}.<ref>{{cite web |title=Bugatti Chiron specifications |url=https://www.auto-data.net/en/bugatti-chiron-model-2112 |website=auto-data.net |access-date=2019-07-31 |archive-date=2019-07-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190723102945/https://www.auto-data.net/en/bugatti-chiron-model-2112 |url-status=live }}</ref>

