The first 200 cars were sold before the first was delivered.<ref name=":0">{{Cite news |url=http://blog.caranddriver.com/bugatti-has-sold-the-first-200-chirons/ |title=Bugatti Has Sold the First 200 Chirons |first=Clifford |last=Atiyeh |work=Car and Driver |location=US |date=2016-08-19 |access-date=2016-12-09 |archive-date=2016-12-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161220102501/http://blog.caranddriver.com/bugatti-has-sold-the-first-200-chirons/ |url-status=live }}</ref> The base price is €2,400,000<ref>{{Cite news |url=http://www.caranddriver.com/features/2017-bugatti-chiron-25-cars-worth-waiting-for-feature-1 |title=2017 Bugatti Chiron: Again with the Overkill |first=Aaron |last=Robinson |work=Car and Driver |location=US |date=2015-05-17 |access-date=2016-12-09 |archive-date=2016-12-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161220102859/http://www.caranddriver.com/features/2017-bugatti-chiron-25-cars-worth-waiting-for-feature-1 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref name=":0" /> and buyers were required to place a €200,000 deposit before their purchase.<ref name=":0" /> The first three Chiron were delivered to their owners in Europe and the Middle East in March 2017.<ref>{{cite press release |title=Bugatti Delivers First Chiron Super Sports Cars To Customers |url=https://newsroom.bugatti.com/press-releases/photo-release-bugatti-delivers-first-chiron-super-sports-cars-to-customers |access-date=23 December 2022 |publisher=Bugatti |date=3 March 2017 |location=Molsheim}}</ref> In January 2022, every Chiron had been sold. In September 2023, Bugatti built the last base-spec (non-variant) Chiron; a Nocturne Black and Copper Chiron with a "Copper" tan interior.<ref>{{Cite web |title=ECR - Bugatti Chiron details |url=https://exclusivecarregistry.com/details/bugatti/chiron/61222 |access-date=2023-12-04 |website=ECR - Bugatti Chiron details |language=en}}</ref> The Chiron production run ended in May 2024 with the Chiron L'Ultime. A North-American market Super Sport model with fading blue paint and writings of the Chiron's history and achievements all over the car.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Calin |first=Razvan |date=2024-05-30 |title=The Ultimate Super Sport: L'Ultime Is the 500th and Last Bugatti Chiron Ever Assembled |url=https://www.autoevolution.com/news/the-ultimate-super-sport-l-ultime-is-the-500th-and-last-bugatti-chiron-ever-assembled-234679.html |access-date=2024-05-30 |website=autoevolution |language=en}}</ref> However, Bugatti still continues to manufacture cars based on the Chiron.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Padeanu |first=Adrian |date=May 30, 2024 |title=Bugatti Swears This Is the Final Chiron |url=https://www.motor1.com/news/721519/bugatti-final-chiron-revealed/ |access-date=May 30, 2024 |website=Motor1.com}}</ref>

