At the [[Geneva Motor Show#2018|2018 Geneva Motor Show]], Bugatti unveiled the track focused version of the Chiron, named the Chiron Sport. Mechanically the car is identical to the regular version, generating {{cvt|1500|PS|kW hp|round=5|abbr=on}} from a [[turbocharger|quad-turbocharged]] [[W16 engine]] but is {{cvt|40|lb|kg|0|abbr=on|order=flip}} lighter due to a lighter, more unrestricted exhaust system, the extensive use of carbon fibre, and a stiffer suspension in order to increase the cornering ability of the car while maintaining its grand touring characteristics. The steering of the car has also received modifications and a torque vectoring system to control the power sent to each wheel of the car for improved handling in tight corners has been added. Aerodynamic improvements and light weight have been given special consideration in order to keep the car competitive on the race track. The Chiron Sport became available in late 2018 for an additional {{currency|400,000|USD|linked=no}} on the standard Chiron.<ref>{{cite news|url=https://money.cnn.com/2018/03/06/luxury/bugatti-chiron-sport-geneva/index.html|title=Bugatti unveils the $3.4M Chiron Sport for the race track|last=Valdes-Dapena|first=Peter|date=2018-03-06|access-date=2018-03-07|website=CNN Money|archive-date=2018-03-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180306103301/http://money.cnn.com/2018/03/06/luxury/bugatti-chiron-sport-geneva/index.html|url-status=dead}}</ref><ref name="TV">{{cite news|url=https://www.theverge.com/2018/3/6/17087432/bugatti-chiron-sport-geneva-motor-show-2018|title=Sitting inside the $3.4M Bugatti Chiron Sport didn't make me a better person|last=Savov|first=Vlad|date=2018-03-06|access-date=2018-03-07|website=The Verge|archive-date=2018-03-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180308041534/https://www.theverge.com/2018/3/6/17087432/bugatti-chiron-sport-geneva-motor-show-2018|url-status=live}}</ref>

In April 2022, Bugatti issued a factory recall for a 2018 Chiron, built 16 November 2017, due to a loose front frame support screw.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Gastelu |first=Gary |date=2022-04-11 |title=Bugatti is recalling a single $3 million car with a screw loose |url=https://www.foxbusiness.com/lifestyle/bugatti-recalling-single-million-car-screw-loose |access-date=2022-04-11 |website=FOXBusiness |location=US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |title=Bugatti Recalls a Single $3 Million Chiron to Inspect Screws |url=https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2022-04-06/bugatti-recalls-a-single-3-3-million-chiron-supercar-to-inspect-screws |first1=Kevin |last1=Miller |first2=Jeff |last2=Green |work=Bloomberg |location=US |date=2022-04-06 |access-date=2022-04-11}}</ref>{{clear}}

=== Chiron Sport 110 Ans Bugatti (2019) ===
{{multiple image
| align = right
| direction = vertical
| width = 200
| image1 = GIMS 2019, Le Grand-Saconnex (GIMS0946).jpg
| image2 = Bugatti Chiron 110 Ans, GIMS 2019, Le Grand-Saconnex (GIMS9980).jpg
