Introduced in February 2019, the 110 Ans Bugatti is a limited edition variant of the Chiron Sport developed to celebrate 110 years of Bugatti. The car features carbon fibre bodywork finished in matte Steel Blue exterior colour. The body is also accented with Steel Blue bare carbon fibre. The exhaust system of the car is finished in matte black colour.

The colours of the French flag are present on the wing mirrors, fuel filler cap and on the underside of the rear wing. The brake calipers are finished in blue colour.

The interior of the car is upholstered in blue Alcantara and also has the colours of the French flag present on the headrests of the seats, on the back of the seats and on top of the steering wheel. Production was limited to 20 units.<ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.topgear.com/car-news/supercars/new-bugatti-chiron-sport-110-ans-bugatti |title=This is the new Bugatti Chiron Sport '110 ans Bugatti' |last=Pattni |first=Vijay |date=2019-02-07 |work=[[Top Gear (magazine)|Top Gear]] |access-date=2019-03-14 |archive-date=2019-02-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190213070518/https://www.topgear.com/car-news/supercars/new-bugatti-chiron-sport-110-ans-bugatti |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.caranddriver.com/news/a26239113/bugatti-chiron-sport-110-ans-bugatti/ |title=The Bugatti Chiron Sport "110 Ans" Edition Celebrates Bugatti's Birthday |last=Golson |first=Daniel |date=2019-02-08 |work=[[Car & Driver]] |access-date=2019-03-14 |archive-date=2019-06-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190609225051/https://www.caranddriver.com/news/a26239113/bugatti-chiron-sport-110-ans-bugatti/ |url-status=live }}</ref>

