=== Chiron Pur Sport (2020) ===
[[File:Bugatti Chiron Pur Sport.jpg|thumb|Bugatti Chiron Pur Sport front view]]

On 3 March 2020, Bugatti introduced the Chiron Pur Sport, a handling-focused model limited to 60 units. The tachometer has an additional 200&nbsp;rpm, increasing the redline to 6,900&nbsp;rpm. 80 per cent of the transmission has been revised for a 15 per cent closer gear-ratio spread benefiting the power band. The Pur Sport is {{cvt|50|kg|lb|0|abbr=on}} lighter than the standard Chiron due to a lightweight 3D printed titanium exhaust, a fixed rear spoiler and extensive use of Alcantara, anodised aluminium and titanium on the interior. The front horseshoe grille is also wider than on a regular Chiron. The wheels have special spokes called "aero blades" which are designed to channel turbulent air near the wheel down the side of the vehicle to the rear diffuser. The tyres are Michelin Sport Cup 2R increasing lateral grip by 10 per cent, and were co-developed with Michelin. To improve handling, the springs were made 65 per cent stiffer at the front and 33 per cent at the rear, aided by revised damper tuning and wheel camber along with additional front and rear carbon-fibre anti-roll bars and a new Sport+ drive mode. Production of the Pur Sport was to start in late 2020.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.caranddriver.com/news/a31210941/bugatti-chiron-pur-sport-photos-info/|title=1500-HP Bugatti Chiron Pur Sport Is a $3.6 Million Apex Hunter|work=[[Car and Driver]]|last=Mortimer|first=Maxwell|date=3 March 2020|access-date=3 March 2020|archive-date=3 March 2020|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200303234802/https://www.caranddriver.com/news/a31210941/bugatti-chiron-pur-sport-photos-info/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://robbreport.com/motors/cars/bugatti-chiron-pur-sport-2902991/|title=Bugatti's New Chiron Pur Sport Is an Even More Responsive Rocket|last=Cava|first=Marco Della|date=2020-03-04|website=Robb Report|language=en|access-date=2020-03-05|archive-date=2020-06-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200603233444/https://robbreport.com/motors/cars/bugatti-chiron-pur-sport-2902991/|url-status=live}}</ref> The first car was delivered to the owner in United States in January 2021.<ref>{{cite press release |title=Bugatti Chiron Pur Sport – Delivery to Customers Begins |url=https://newsroom.bugatti.com/press-releases/bugatti-chiron-pur-sport-delivery-to-customers-begins |access-date=23 December 2022 |publisher=Bugatti |date=15 January 2021 |location=Molsheim/Greenwich}}</ref> Deliveries reached the halfway mark on 1 December 2022.<ref>{{cite press release |title=Bugatti Chiron Pur Sport – 'Drifting The C' |url=https://www.bugatti.com/media/news/2022/bugatti-chiron-pur-sport-drifting-the-c/ |access-date=23 December 2022 |publisher=Bugatti |date=1 December 2022 |location=Molsheim}}</ref>

