=== Chiron Sport Les Légendes du Ciel (2020) ===
[[File:Bugatti Chiron Sport Les Legendes Du Ciel.jpg|thumb|Bugatti Chiron Sport Les Légendes Du Ciel]]

Introduced in November 2020, the "Les Légendes du Ciel" Chiron is a limited-edition version of the Chiron Sport developed to celebrate Bugatti's racing drivers that flew in the French Air Force.

The car features a new grille, a French flag behind the front wheels, a matte grey ("Gris Serpent") exterior colour with a gloss white stripe in the centre. The interior is upholstered in tan leather and turned aluminium.

Production was limited to 20 units and started in late 2020 at €2.88 million each.<ref>{{Cite web|date=2020-11-24|title=This special edition Chiron Sport is Bugatti's tribute to pilots|url=https://www.topgear.com/car-news/special-edition-chiron-sport-bugattis-tribute-pilots|access-date=2021-01-21|website=Top Gear|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{cite press release |title=Bugatti Chiron Sport "Les Légendes Du Ciel" |url=https://newsroom.bugatti.com/press-releases/bugatti-chiron-sport-les-legendes-du-ciel |access-date=23 December 2022 |publisher=Bugatti |date=24 November 2020 |location=Molsheim}}</ref>

