On 8 June 2021, Bugatti introduced the standard version of the 300+ world record car.<ref>{{cite press release |title=The Bugatti Chiron Super Sport – The Quintessence of Luxury and Speed |url=https://newsroom.bugatti.com/press-releases/the-bugatti-chiron-super-sport-the-quintessence-of-luxury-and-speed |access-date=23 December 2022 |publisher=Bugatti |date=8 June 2021 |location=Molsheim}}</ref> Unlike the 300+, it does not come with interior stiffening and has more leather in the interior like a typical Bugatti Chiron. More visual differences include special redesigned wheels<ref>{{Cite web|last=Padeanu|first=Adrian|date=June 8, 2021|title=Bugatti Chiron Super Sport Revealed As The Ultimate 273-MPH Grand Tourer|url=https://www.motor1.com/news/512612/bugatti-chiron-super-sport-reveal/|url-status=live|access-date=June 14, 2021|website=Motor 1|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210608080325/https://www.motor1.com/news/512612/bugatti-chiron-super-sport-reveal/ |archive-date=2021-06-08 }}</ref> and a paint finish instead of the bare carbon fibre seen in the 300+. The Chiron Super Sport had the same power output as the 300+ but was limited to {{convert|440|km/h|mph|0|abbr=on}}. It also has the capability to accelerate from {{convert|0-200|km/h|mph|0|abbr=on}} in 5.8 seconds and from {{convert|0-300|km/h|mph|0|abbr=on}} in 12.1 seconds. Unlike the 300+, the limiter cannot be disabled by Bugatti in the Super Sport for prepared runs. Customer delivery started in early 2022 at a net unit price of {{euro|3.2 million}} each. The first car was delivered in April 2022.<ref>{{cite press release |title=Bugatti Delivers First Chiron Super Sports to Customers |url=https://newsroom.bugatti.com/press-releases/bugatti-delivers-first-chiron-super-sports-to-customers |access-date=23 December 2022 |publisher=Bugatti |date=4 April 2022 |location=Molsheim}}</ref> About 70–80 were built, including the L'Ultime, which is the very last of the Chiron series. It is the last car to use the [[Bugatti W16 engine]], and likely the last car to use an engine of this layout in general.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.autobild.de/artikel/bugatti-chiron-super-sport-2022-preis-ps-kaufen-topspeed-technische-daten-test-21338197.html/ |title=Der 1600 PS starke Bugatti Chiron Super Sport macht sprachlos |first=Jan |last=Götze |date=3 April 2022 |access-date=8 April 2022 |work=AutoBild |archive-date=2022-04-03  |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220403141624/https://www.autobild.de/artikel/bugatti-chiron-super-sport-2022-preis-ps-kaufen-topspeed-technische-daten-test-21338197.html |url-status=dead }}</ref>

